  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">JPO st&#xf6;d</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">JPO support - JPO support AVSLUTAD</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Insatsen avser psykologst&#xf6;d vid hemkomst efter JPO/SARC tj&#xe4;nstg&#xf6;ring. JPO/SARC befinner sig ofta i komplexa milj&#xf6;er, t.ex. i humanit&#xe4;ra insatser, och uts&#xe4;tts ibland f&#xf6;r oerh&#xf6;rd stress och f&#xf6;rh&#xf6;jd s&#xe4;kerhetsrisk.JPO/SARC har psykologst&#xf6;d fr&#xe5;n FN under sin tj&#xe4;nstg&#xf6;ring men st&#xe5;r utan st&#xf6;d vid kontraktsslut.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The contribution refers to psychological support for JPO/SARC who return from duty. JPO/SARC is often found in complex environments, such as humanitarian action, and sometimes exposed to enormous stress and increased security risk. JPO/SARC have psychological support from UN during their duty but are left without after end of contract.</narrative>
  </description>
